  "//onnxruntime-node": "Pinned below 1.24. @huggingface/transformers wants 1.24.3, whose bundled onnxruntime ships ArmKleidiAI SME2 matmul kernels that die with SIGILL on Apple Silicon mid-embedding, taking the whole server down. 1.23.2 contains no KleidiAI symbols at all. See docs/ux-redesign-plan.md.",
  "overrides": {
    "onnxruntime-node": "1.23.2"
  },
